.","**Your call.** — A decisão é sua.","**It’s a deal.** — Fechado.","**That’s the spirit.** — Esse é o espírito.","**Did your lawyer endorse it?** — Seu advogado endossou?","**She did, but only half.** — Endossou, mas só metade.","**Would you sign if I did?** — Você assinaria se eu assinasse?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"endorse","pt":"endossar, apoiar","forms":[["I / you / we / they endorse","The board endorses the plan."],["he / she / it endorses","O conselho endossa o plano."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Cartoon club","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Cartoon club","lines":[["Ines","Did your lawyer endorse it?","Seu advogado endossou?"],["Theo","She did, but only half.","Endossou, mas só metade."],["Ines","Would you sign if I did?","Você assinaria se eu assinasse?"],["Theo","I would, if she let me.","Assinaria, se ela deixasse."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Ênfase intencional","items":[{"label":"Ênfase intencional","note":"Pausas e ritmo: faça uma pausa curta entre grupos de sentido (thought groups) e acelere as palavras fracas entre os acentos.","words":["If we agree, | we can sign today.","The offer, | as it stands, | is unacceptable.","By Friday | we will have been talking | for a week."]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Answer with ellipsis.","pt":"Responda.","model":"Will you sign? — I will if you will."},{"q":"Use do so.","pt":"Use.","model":"The firm settled and did so quietly."},{"q":"Use one.","pt":"Use.","model":"I prefer the blue one."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 4-panel comic script (8 lines) using ellipsis.","model":"Panel 1 — A: I’ll go if you will. B: I would, but I can’t. Panel 2 — A: Why not? B: My boss won’t let me. Panel 3 — A: Ask him to. B: I did, and he said no. Panel 4 — A: Then I won’t either. B: Good, neither of us will.","checklist":["Us